      {
        "t": "mistake",
        "html": "<b>gen</b> appears in words so different you may miss it: <i>genesis</i>, <i>ingenious</i>, <i>ingenuous</i>, <i>engender</i> and <i>genial</i> (friendly and cheerful) all trace back to it. And do not confuse <b>ingenious</b> (clever) with <b>ingenuous</b> (innocent)."
